Feature: native selected-window borders
License: GPL-3.0-or-later (see COPYING and individual source headers)

Ported from the feature history between
53d81d2cc164f597cba6afd80e2fa7bcf1c8134f and
c2e4e7e10e5cae4f590075ff1bd12965e9a9a712 (2025-11-01), plus the text-bottom correction in
e59362fc605711e4a22c56522bfb313f4611b536.

See patches/gnu-emacs31-window-border.patch. GNU Emacs 31 iterator
and scrolling algorithms are retained; the port adds their border padding.
The Cairo renderer and scroll-bar placement in pgtkterm.c are local PGTK
adaptations. Minibuffer, pseudo windows and terminal frames reserve no border.
